[471.634433, "o", "npx convex --help 2>&1 | head -50\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[472.196366, "o", "Usage: convex <command> [options]\r\n\r\nStart developing with Convex by running `npx convex dev`.\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  dev [options]                        Develop against a dev deployment,\r\n                                       watching for changes\r\n  deploy [options]                     Deploy to a production or preview\r\n                                       deployment\r\n  run [options] [functionName] [args]  Run a function or evaluate an inline\r\n                                       readonly query on your deployment\r\n  import [options] <path>              Import data from a file to your\r\n                                       deployment\r\n  dashboard|dash [options]             Open the dashboard in the browser\r\n  docs [options]                       Open the docs in the browser\r\n  logs [options]                       Watch logs from your deployment\r\n  export [options]                     Export data from your deployment to a ZIP\r\n                                       file\r\n  env [options]                        Set and view environment variables\r\n  data [options] [table]               List tables and print data from your\r\n                                       database\r\n  deployment                           Manage deployments\r\n  project                              Manage projects\r\n  codegen [options]                    Generate backend type definitions\r\n  update                               Print instructions for updating the\r\n                                       convex package\r\n  logout                               Log out of Convex on this machine\r\n  function-spec [options]              List function metadata from your\r\n                                       deployment\r\n  insights [options]                   Show health insights for your deployment\r\n  mcp                                  Manage the Model Context Protocol server\r\n                                       for Convex [BETA]\r\n  ai-files                             Manage Convex AI files\r\n  help <command>                       Show help for given <command>\r\n"]
[472.213868, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@59e54423-a59a-4a98-bdc1-cf1c2f9179f0:/home/user/my-app# "]
[481.589301, "i", "npx convex deployment --help 2>&1\n"]
[481.589491, "o", "npx convex deployment --help 2>&1\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[482.125938, "o", "Usage: convex deployment [options] [command]\r\n\r\nManage deployments in your project.\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -h, --help                    display help for command\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  select <deployment>           Select the deployment to use when running commands\r\n  create [options] [reference]  Create a new deployment for a project\r\n  token                         Manage access tokens\r\n  help [command]                display help for command\r\n"]
[482.133768, "o", "⠙"]
